        "body": "## Summary\r\n- drop trailing reasoning items from prompt history before the next user message\r\n- drop trailing reasoning items at prompt end before replaying history to `/responses`\r\n- add focused history tests covering interrupted-turn cleanup and a valid reasoning chain\r\n\r\n## Context\r\nThis is the minimal shared-harness fix for the guardian failure mode in #15341. It avoids protocol changes and trims replay-unsafe trailing reasoning in the common prompt normalization path used by both guardian and the main Codex harness.\r\n",
