        "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
        "body": "## Summary\n- Remove the test's dependency on shell snapshot file creation as a synchronization point, since intercepted `apply_patch` can bypass normal shell execution.\n- Assert the intended interception behavior directly via `PatchApplyBegin` / `PatchApplyEnd` and verify no `ExecCommandBegin` / `ExecCommandEnd` events are emitted for the call.\n- Increase the shell timeout to 5s and wrap the event wait in a bounded 10s timeout to fail clearly instead of hanging.\n\n## Testing\n- `cd codex-rs && just fmt`\n- `cd codex-rs && cargo test -p codex-core shell_command_snapshot_still_intercepts_apply_patch -- --nocapture`",
